<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash Jan wheat steady to slightly weaker.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash Jan wheat steady to slightly weaker.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine January cash wheat prices on the Buenos Aires Cereals exchange were steady to slightly weaker in quiet trade, as the advancing harvest kept the market strong on offer, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cash maize and soybean both continued trading quietly firm with good spot demand from crushers and expectations of strong demand for most of the coming year.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
